// An organisational subfolder INSIDE a submodule. detail/ holds no file named
// detail.cone, so it draws no module: its files are geometry's, at any depth,
// which is what lets a module group its files by topic without minting a
// namespace for them.
//
// The two kinds of subfolder sit side by side under geometry/ -- this one and
// scaling/, which does hold its designated file -- and one probe tells them apart.

fn marginOf(n i64) i64 {
  n + 5i64;
}
